\viewkind4\uc1\pard\qj\kerning2\f0\fs24 The City Commission recognized Susan Lainfiesta, Special Events Manager, as \ldblquote Employee of the Year\rdblquote . Starting as an intern, she rose through the Parks & Recreation Department due to her exceptional attention to detail, leadership, and ability to deliver flawless community events-from farmers markets to large-scale celebrations. Commissioners praised her work ethic, grace under pressure, and the consistently high-quality public experience she ensures. Mayor Lago emphasized that her positive attitude and precision reflect the very best of Coral Gables. \cf1\kerning0\f1\par
}

